@startuml
title AssetIndex：文件索引模块（skeleton）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "api" {
  interface AssetIndexCommandService {
    +runInitialFullScan()
    +runIncrementalScan(trigger)
  }
  interface AssetQueryService {
    +listPreviewAssets(criteria)
    +searchNetcdfAssets(criteria)
    +findNetcdfCandidates(criteria)
  }
  interface DownloadAssetLookup {
    +findDownloadableAsset(assetId)
  }
  interface AssetAdminQueryService {
    +getLatestScanResult()
    +searchScanHistory(query)
  }
  class IndexedAssetView <<record>>
  class DownloadableAsset <<record>>
  class AssetScanResult <<record>>
}

package "domain" {
  class DataAsset <<record>>
}
package "application" {
  class MockAssetIndex <<skeleton mock>>
}
interface "CatalogQueryService\n(Catalog API)" as CatalogQuery

MockAssetIndex ..|> AssetIndexCommandService
MockAssetIndex ..|> AssetQueryService
MockAssetIndex ..|> DownloadAssetLookup
MockAssetIndex ..|> AssetAdminQueryService
MockAssetIndex --> CatalogQuery : 文件族对应哪些产品
MockAssetIndex ..> IndexedAssetView : 返回索引视图
MockAssetIndex ..> DownloadableAsset : 返回下载受限视图
MockAssetIndex ..> AssetScanResult : 返回扫描结果

note bottom
当前 Mock 不扫描硬盘；真实实现会扫描正式目录并维护文件索引。
end note
@enduml
